{"seq":5,"slug":"level-and-compensation","title":"Level And Compensation","docCount":4,"url":"/h/corporate-management/binance/level-and-compensation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"career-level-system","title":"Binance 职级体系","url":"/h/corporate-management/binance/level-and-compensation/career-level-system","wordCount":2465,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"compensation-structure","title":"Binance 薪酬福利体系","url":"/h/corporate-management/binance/level-and-compensation/compensation-structure","wordCount":2507,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-evaluation","title":"Binance 绩效考核体系","url":"/h/corporate-management/binance/level-and-compensation/performance-evaluation","wordCount":2512,"readingTime":11},{"seq":4,"slug":"workplace-survival-guide","title":"Binance 职场生存指南","url":"/h/corporate-management/binance/level-and-compensation/workplace-survival-guide","wordCount":3228,"readingTime":13}],"introMarkdown":"Binance 作为全球最大的加密货币交易所，其职级与薪酬体系兼具 Web3 行业的独特性和全球化远程组织的复杂性。与传统科技公司不同，Binance 的薪酬结构融合了法币、稳定币和 BNB 代币激励，职级体系也在合规转型期经历了从\"扁平化创业风格\"到\"制度化治理框架\"的演进。本章从职级体系、薪酬福利、绩效考核和职场生存策略四个维度，系统解析 Binance 员工的职业发展全景。无论你是考虑加入 Binance 的候选人，还是对 Web3 行业薪酬体系感兴趣的管理研究者，都能从中获得有价值的参考框架。\n"}